# One real-time voice turn, using the existing product's reader and stand-in microphone.
# The fixture's member confirmation reaches home at about 5.4 s: its durable writes queue behind the
# boot-time card index (file-index-3). Was 3 s; the storage-order follow-up should bring it back.
@7s       tap 68% 92%
+2500ms   tap 50% 160dp
+3s       key next
+2s       mic speech
+0ms      key ai 1200ms
+6500ms   end
